    "overview": "Take a position on a hard question, then prepare to discuss it with classmates who disagree.",
    "prompt": "Is it ever right to break a promise? Write a short argument: state your position, give one reason with a specific example (from your life, a story or history), then write the strongest objection someone could make and your reply. Bring it to a small-group discussion. In the discussion, before you reply to a classmate who sees it differently, name the strongest part of their argument. After the discussion, add two sentences: did anything a classmate said change or sharpen your thinking?",
